/p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f <strong>Tech Specs:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Always-on-top mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low resource usage</strong> (lightweight performance)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable transparency</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\ude80 Unlike static weather widgets, Sol &amp; Luna are digital pets with real emotions!</i></p>",
